# Review Workflow Test

This test demonstrates the proposed status lifecycle: new issues start as proposed, `review` lists what is waiting for approval, approving moves an issue to `todo`, and `--approved` creates issues as `todo` directly.

## Review lists only proposed issues

r[verify review-command]
```console
$ pebbles review
aaaaaaaa [bug] [PROPOSED] Proposed bug

```

## List can filter by proposed status

```console
$ pebbles list --status proposed
aaaaaaaa [bug] [PROPOSED] Proposed bug

```

## Approved issues are not in the review queue

```console
$ pebbles list --status todo
bbbbbbbb [uc] [TODO] Approved usecase

```

## Approve a proposed issue

```console
$ pebbles status aaaaaaaa todo
✓ Updated issue status
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ID: aaaaaaaa-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Title: Proposed bug
Type: Bug
Status: TODO

Created: 2026-01-03 12:00:00
Updated: [..]
File: bug-aaaaaaaa-proposed-bug.json
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

```

## Review is empty once nothing is proposed

```console
$ pebbles review
No issues found.

```

## New issues start as proposed

r[verify new-issues-default-proposed]
```console
$ pebbles new "Fresh idea" --issue-type bug
Created bug [..]
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ID: [..]
Title: Fresh idea
Type: Bug
Status: PROPOSED

Created: [..]
Updated: [..]
File: bug-[..]-fresh-idea.json
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

```

## --approved creates issues as todo

```console
$ pebbles new "Approved now" --issue-type usecase --approved
Created usecase [..]
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ID: [..]
Title: Approved now
Type: Usecase
Status: TODO

Created: [..]
Updated: [..]
File: uc-[..]-approved-now.json
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

```

## Review lists only the still-proposed issue

```console
$ pebbles review
[..] [bug] [PROPOSED] Fresh idea

```

## Todo list includes approved issues newest first

```console
$ pebbles list --status todo
[..] [uc] [TODO] Approved now
aaaaaaaa [bug] [TODO] Proposed bug
bbbbbbbb [uc] [TODO] Approved usecase

```
